       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COBOL002.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  WS-NOMBRE PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-NOMBRE-SIN-ESPACIO PIC X(30).
       01  CT-HOLA   PIC X(04) VALUE 'HOLA'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
            ACCEPT WS-NOMBRE
            MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NOMBRE TRAILING) TO
                 WS-NOMBRE-SIN-ESPACIO
            DISPLAY CT-HOLA "," WS-NOMBRE-SIN-ESPACIO
            STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM COBOL002.
